Changelog::kv
Summary::md .summary
  It's useful to be able to have a background image that won't get
  selected and is basically read only.

Update::md .update
  In thinking about this, this isn't useful for dungeon maps.
  There are situations this is useful, but it's for other use cases, which would need their own optimized interface I believe.

Update::md .update
  I am closing this feature as WONTFIX.
